==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>.
*1 [[Red EnerG]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kappy Kawano]] spawns as the boss after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Raynard]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Red EnerG]] spawns.
**3 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune units]] are even more important this stage, with the addition of a Raynard and some Red EnerGs along with the [[Surge Attack|Surge]]-spamming Kappy Kawano. [[Talents|Talented]] [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] are viable meatshields, as per usual. Your main goal is to just chip down Kawano in between the infinite peons. [[Can Can Cat]], [[Pizza Cat]], and [[Courier Cat]] are good options to quickly contain each supporting threat. [[Bullet Train Cat]] can be used to snipe the Gory Darks and Hyppohs for a cash boost while chipping down Kawano.

==Trivia==
*"Ghost" is a translation of 妖怪 ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]'', a class of supernatural creatures and phenomena in Japanese folklore. The ''[[wikipedia:Kappa (folklore)|kappa]]'' is an example of a ''yōkai''.

